      "concern": "The headless concurrency semaphore is still contradictory: §1.4.4 says it is mandatory, but the same section's Activation text says it is only introduced if stress tests discover corruption and not introduced if all CLIs pass.",
      "severity": "HIGH",
      "severity_score": 780,
