      "location": "§1.4.4 Headless adapter concurrency semaphore, §5.6 Concurrency semaphore design, §8 T2.14",
      "recommendation": "Delete the conditional Activation paragraph from §1.4.4. State unambiguously that the module is always introduced, with FR-8.6 only setting per-CLI N values.",
      "source": "tertiary_skeptic"
